@startuml 01f-deployment-image-contents
!include ../_style.iuml
title Pi-Gen imaging: what stage-ivalice-base bakes into the unified ivalice image

artifact IMG [
<b>ivalice.img</b>  (one image for all 6 nodes, role chosen at first boot)
]

folder BOOT [
<b>bootfs  /boot/firmware</b>
cmdline.txt  += cgroup_memory=1 cgroup_enable=memory cgroup_enable=cpuset
userconf.txt  ivalice:<sha512 of FIRST_USER_PASS>  (0600)
ivalice-node.conf.template  (NODE_ROLE, NODE_HOSTNAME, NODE_IP, NODE_K3S)
<i>ivalice-node.conf is NOT in the image; personalize-node.sh writes it</i>
]

folder ETC [
<b>/etc  (files/ overlay + generated)</b>
slurm/slurm.conf  ClusterName=ivalice, ctld=dalmasca, 5 x (4 CPU, 7800 MB)
munge/munge.key  (assets, 0400 munge:munge)
systemd/network/10-eth0.network.template  Address=~__STATIC_ADDRESS~__
systemd/system/ivalice-firstboot.service, ivalice-postboot-ansible.service
cloud/cloud.cfg.d/99-ivalice.cfg, cloud/templates/hosts.debian.tmpl
rancher/k3s/config.head.yaml, config.worker.yaml (token baked in)
avahi/avahi-daemon.conf  (eth0, IPv4 only)
containers/registries.conf, storage.conf  (fuse-overlayfs)
logrotate.d/ivalice, subuid/subgid ivalice:100000:65536
resolv.conf -> systemd-resolved stub
]

folder OPT [
<b>/opt/ivalice + /usr/local</b>
/opt/ivalice/ansible: site.yml, inventory, 6 roles, 6 playbooks
/opt/ivalice/bin/run-ansible.sh
/usr/local/sbin/ivalice-firstboot.sh, ivalice-wait-for-workers.sh
/usr/local/bin/k3s, /usr/local/sbin/k3s-install.sh
/var/lib/rancher/k3s/agent/images/k3s-airgap-images-arm64.tar.zst
/var/lib/rancher/k3s/server/token
/root/.ssh/ivalice-cluster[.pub]  (private key removed on workers at first boot)
]

folder HOME [
<b>/home/ivalice  (UID 1000)</b>
.zshrc, .oh-my-zsh/ (from tarball), .config/nvim/init.lua
.bashrc.d/ivalice.sh  (KUBECONFIG helper)
authorized_keys = operator key + cluster key (pi-gen PUBKEY_SSH_FIRST_USER)
login shell zsh, editor nvim
]

component SVC [
<b>systemd state at bake time</b>
ENABLED: ssh, avahi-daemon, systemd-networkd, systemd-resolved,
         munge, cloud-init.target, ivalice-firstboot
DISABLED: slurmctld, slurmd, k3s, k3s-agent
NOT ENABLED (left alone): ivalice-postboot-ansible
MASKED: NetworkManager, NetworkManager-wait-online
chroot assertions check: munge enabled, slurmctld/slurmd
not enabled, k3s + k3s-agent disabled
]

IMG *-- BOOT
IMG *-- ETC
IMG *-- OPT
IMG *-- HOME
IMG *-- SVC

note bottom of OPT #FFE4E1
  FINDING: nothing NFS-related is installed (no nfs-kernel-server /
  nfs-common in 00-packages, no export, no fstab entry), yet README and
  CLAUDE.md verify steps run "mountpoint /srv/ivalice". Playbooks
  55-nfs.yml and 60-sphinx-asr.yml are listed as "to be added".
end note
@enduml
